# Local synthetic demo; Node 24+; binds exclusively to 127.0.0.1:4317.
# No external integration credentials required.
# By default, distinct random demo account passwords are generated each server start
# and printed ONLY in the terminal. These passwords are exchanged for short-lived, HTTP-only session cookies.
#
# Optional: set distinct random strings, each 32–256 characters, through your
# process environment (this file is documentation, not automatically loaded).
#
# NORTHLINE_COORDINATOR_KEY=<supply-a-different-long-random-secret>
# NORTHLINE_REVIEWER_KEY=<supply-a-long-random-secret>
#
# Never commit real keys. These authorize local demo account access, not verified individual
# identities or production manufacturing approvals.
# PDF imports require pdftotext on PATH (Poppler).

# Optional stable Ed25519 signing identity for synthetic approved releases.
# NORTHLINE_ATTESTATION_PRIVATE_KEY_FILE=/safe/outside/repo/demo-ed25519-private.pem
# If unset, the app creates a new ephemeral signing identity at every server boot.
# Never commit private keys or treat embedded public keys as a trust anchor.
